# HANGTEST=nanddrv (docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md, nandps4): nandres
# (plain nandboot + hang watchdog + the two no-map areas, no pstore) plus
# CONFIG_MV61X0_DUMMY_PDRV: a platform driver that binds nothing, registered
# at postcore_initcall like ramoops_driver in nandps3.
# DEBUG IMAGE ONLY: it arms a hardware watchdog, so each run needs the
# owner's OK.
CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=ttyS0,115200n8 marvell_nand.write_window=1741,4091 panic=10 consoleblank=0 timer_mv61x0.hang_wdt=30"
CONFIG_MV61X0_DUMMY_PDRV=y
